Flying\n\
When this creature enters, exile target spell. It becomes plotted. (Its owner may cast it as a sorcery on a later turn without paying its mana cost.)\n\
Spells your opponents cast from graveyards or from exile cost {2} more to cast.",
      "power": "2",
      "toughness": "2",
    },
